1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,700
Travel 2,000 km for the Rainbow Mountains — and see grey? I'm your China Travel Expert.

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:05,100
Zhangye Danxia: about 74 yuan, ten dollars at the gate.

3
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,600
Millions of years of sandstone, striped red, gold and green.

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:10,000
But at noon the flat light turns them dull and grey.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,500
The colors only blaze at sunrise and late afternoon.

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,100
Go June to October — the hues peak right after rain.

7
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:17,600
Double-tap if you'd time a trip around the light.

8
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:20,200
Skip the grey midday; stay for the 6 pm glow.

9
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,800
★ Expert Tip: catch the last shuttle — sunset is the real payoff.

10
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:25,600
So: worth 2,000 km for one hour of light? Tell me.
